dn_density.py -- task-2 / R3 : is  sup|grad S_W|^2 ∝ L^4  a growth or the face count?
SU(2), beta = 2.5, bi-invariant frame (G = delta), periodic torus, L = 2,4,6,8
normalisation: |grad S_W|^2 = sum_l sum_a g[l,a]^2  (identical to mc_lattice.py 'gradnorm')
============================================================================================================

